            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ebedeeb"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Just finished cooking the first batch...awesome recipe. My fish combo was a bit different, but all measurements were the same...but doubled. Im sure my guests will enjoy it at the seder tommorrow.",
            "datePublished": "2011-04-17T13:52:13.267Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "empearls"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very tasty! It took me about an hour to assemble the fish mixture and by then it was too late for me too cook so I popped the stock and mixture into the fridge to work on in the morning. I ended up with 46 \"loaves.\" Next time I will scale down the recipe as I have 16 people over for first seder and 4 people for the second. I also omitted the ice water. If you like salt, you might want to add more.",
            "datePublished": "2013-03-23T13:02:21.960Z"
          },
          {
